            "review_title": "Review at Xanhdeli",
            "review_text": "Freedom30087482982\n2 contributions\n0\nGreat experience\nApr 2024 • Couples\nHealthy food options are diverse, sandwiches and salads are fresh and delicious, chicken breasts are succulent and not dry at all. Handcrafted kombucha drinks are delicious. In addition, the price is cheap compared to the quality. Cute staff, enthusiastic service, I will come back next time!\nShow original\nWritten April 25, 2024",
